# ml-shared

Shared Python package containing core LLM routing client (`llm_client.py`), AI usage cost tracking (`ai_usage_logger.py`), and Supabase client (`supabase_client.py`) for Cadence ML microservices (`ml-analysis`, `ml-audio`, `recommendation-service`).
